  "scope_manifest": {
    "task": "plan/work-skills/07-integrated-process-candidate.md",
    "criteria": {
      "Delivers": "A simple user guide, revised operation instructions and shared formats, portable method bundles, and observed scratch-fixture results for the process requested on 2026-09-19.\n\nThis user-selected work combines the candidate implementation surfaces of core-model/02, shared-methods/01 and 05, project setup, work-skills/01 to 05, and context routing. Their original tasks retain their individual acceptance and release obligations; this task does not declare those packages complete. The candidate choices are in decision 0028 and the operation contracts in skills/README.md.",
      "Check by": "Run project and packaging checks, exercise the evidence helper with changed content and requirements, and use independent fresh agents on isolated software and non-code fixtures. Inspect the resulting artifacts and routes, including repeated commands with no new information.",
      "Done when": "- [] The guide explains the normal route, small work, changed scope, waiting, and all nine skills.\n- [] Each operation declares its reads, owned changes, finish, and recovery without repeating the shared formats.\n- [] Work and decision dependencies stay distinct; stable identities survive presentation changes.\n- [] Build and review remain separate; acceptance names output and scope, and part completion checks the combined Outcome.\n- [] Repeated waiting, stale handoffs, missing output, review findings, and an incomplete part Outcome produce actionable progress or an honest wait.\n- [] Shared methods and helpers have one authored source and verified consumer copies.\n- [] Scratch runs cover software, non-code work, and setup; results and limits are recorded without claiming universal or release acceptance."
    },
